'''Smiles at Cats''' (ネコの前で見せる笑顔, ''Neko no Mae de Miseru Egao'', '''Smiles in Front of Cats''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Freeze" Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

